{
  "name": "Global Error Handler",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "22c2ea91-276e-478a-9f35-c9a5579fb093",
      "name": "Error Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.errorTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        250,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "duplicateItem": false,
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "fe289517-4355-4aee-ad2d-8598b2ee2b3f",
              "name": "error_message",
              "value": "={{ $json.message }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "6bb50bdf-efb4-41d0-9d0b-d600430d540b",
              "name": "workflow_name",
              "value": "={{ $json.workflow.name }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "dded16d2-46a2-405b-ba8b-7e6bfbc28f49",
              "name": "node_name",
              "value": "={{ $json.execution.error.node.name }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "8ba6f994-f880-4c52-b846-cf654a1b12f9",
              "name": "timestamp",
              "value": "={{ $now.toISO() }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "4418e85b-efe1-4901-8715-63dfb4485638",
              "name": "execution_id",
              "value": "={{ $json.execution.id }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "e7c57cff-08c5-4ff0-a2f3-5a907898c7e7",
              "name": "severity",
              "value": "={{ $json.execution.error.message.includes('timeout') || $json.execution.error.message.includes('rate') ? 'critical' : 'warning' }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "319b0d6e-ec91-4051-b2fc-db06e92e7b6d",
      "name": "Parse Error",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        500,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "outputKey": "critical",
              "conditions": {
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.severity }}",
                    "rightValue": "critical",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "outputKey": "warning",
              "conditions": {
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.severity }}",
                    "rightValue": "warning",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "fallbackOutput": 1
      },
      "id": "96b370bd-5ecc-46a8-a4a3-ff67ef338c2e",
      "name": "Severity Switch",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        750,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "sendMessage",
        "channel": "#n8n-errors",
        "text": "🔴 **CRITICAL ERROR**\nWorkflow: {{ $json.workflow_name }}\nNode: {{ $json.node_name }}\nError: {{ $json.error_message }}\nTime: {{ $json.timestamp }}\nExecution: {{ $json.execution_id }}"
      },
      "id": "d66c75ae-c83d-4d1e-9429-917c986d65a4",
      "name": "Critical Slack Alert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1000,
        200
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "slackApi": {
          "id": "PLACEHOLDER",
          "name": "Slack Account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "send",
        "to": "admin@example.com",
        "subject": "🔴 CRITICAL n8n Error: {{ $json.workflow_name }}",
        "message": "Critical error in workflow {{ $json.workflow_name }} at node {{ $json.node_name }}.\n\nError: {{ $json.error_message }}\nTime: {{ $json.timestamp }}\n\nPlease investigate immediately."
      },
      "id": "48dbcade-0340-47f7-a13c-edd68bc9b5fb",
      "name": "Critical Email Alert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        1000,
        400
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "gmailOAuth2": {
          "id": "PLACEHOLDER",
          "name": "Gmail Account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": "PLACEHOLDER_SPREADSHEET_ID",
        "sheetName": "ErrorLog",
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "workflow_name": "={{ $json.workflow_name }}",
            "node_name": "={{ $json.node_name }}",
            "error_message": "={{ $json.error_message }}",
            "severity": "={{ $json.severity }}",
            "timestamp": "={{ $json.timestamp }}",
            "execution_id": "={{ $json.execution_id }}"
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "518c85b1-80e6-4163-bb63-4781b7988eb1",
      "name": "Warning Log Sheet",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        1000,
        600
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "PLACEHOLDER",
          "name": "Google Sheets"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "push",
        "key": "n8n_error_dlq",
        "value": "={{ JSON.stringify($json) }}",
        "options": {
          "ttl": 86400
        }
      },
      "id": "8525099b-61f5-43a4-a0f7-e0dda75788cc",
      "name": "DLQ Push to Redis",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.redis",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1250,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "redis": {
          "id": "PLACEHOLDER",
          "name": "Redis"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Global Error Handler\n\n- **Critical errors**: Slack + Email immediate alert\n- **Warnings**: Logged to Google Sheets\n- **All errors**: Pushed to Redis DLQ for retry\n- **Link this as Error Workflow in ALL other workflows**\n\nSettings → Error Workflow → this workflow",
        "width": 300,
        "height": 250
      },
      "id": "6270dbde-1c49-4bc2-91cd-155c12b8415d",
      "name": "📋 Documentation",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        50,
        100
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Error Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Parse Error",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Parse Error": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Severity Switch",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Severity Switch": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Critical Slack Alert",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "Warning Log Sheet",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Critical Slack Alert": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "DLQ Push to Redis",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Critical Email Alert": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "DLQ Push to Redis",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Warning Log Sheet": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "DLQ Push to Redis",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "versionId": "2246765f-eeed-4673-8346-452ab8d3eb18",
  "meta": {
    "instanceId": "7b8a56fa-e2c2-4ef0-bc74-29ee7fbe5a0c"
  },
  "pinData": {},
  "id": "",
